        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana MP21516, Small Edge Cabinet Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Small Edge Cabinet Pull is a great, low profile cabinet pull that will add a modern touch to your kitchen. This contemporary cabinet door pull is just shy of 3 inches long with a slim projection, making it an excellent choice for kitchen remodels. It is available in oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, and polished chrome finishes. The 2-15/16 Inch Modern Edge Cabinet Hidden Pull can be installed vertically or horizontally for both cabinet drawers or cabinet doors. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MP21516-Specifications.gif?v=1704354682\" width=\"474\" height=\"234\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana MP21516 Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/medium-modern-hidden-cabinet-pull-deltana-mp578\"><b>Deltana MP578 Medium Edge Cabinet Pull</b></a> and\r\n<a href=\"/products/large-modern-hidden-cabinet-pull-deltana-mp9116\"><b>Deltana MP9116 Large Edge Cabinet Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MP21516-installed.jpg?v=1704352953\" width=\"257\" height=\"247\" border=\"0\" align=\"right\" alt=\"Deltana MP21516 Installed\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern 2-15/16\" Cabinet Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Aluminum</li>\r\n<li>Length: 2-15/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Projection: 1-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Can be installed either vertically or horizontally.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with installation hardware.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-MP21516-specifications.pdf?v=1704262341\"><b>Deltana MP21516 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
