                "title": "2-15/16 Inch Modern Hidden Cabinet Pull",
                "description": "The Small Edge Cabinet Pull is a great, low profile cabinet pull that will add a modern touch to your kitchen. This contemporary cabinet door pull is just shy of 3 inches long with a slim projection, making it an excellent choice for kitchen remodels. It is available in oil rubbed bronze, satin nickel, and polished chrome finishes. The 2-15/16 Inch Modern Edge Cabinet Pull can be installed vertically or horizontally for both cabinet drawers or cabinet doors.",
